<title>USA: Harris Cty MUD 356, Texas, won by Coastal Sec.</title>
<headline>Harris Cty MUD 356, Texas, won by Coastal Sec.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coastal Sec. said it won $1.215 million of Harris County Municipal Utility District 356, Texas, with a net interest cost of 5.607 percent.</p>
</text>
